SUMMARY:Sabor Latino
DESCRIPTION:Sabor Latino is a weekly Latin night at La Terraza\, a tapas bar and restaurant in the heart of Clapham North. The evening kicks off with a free introductory salsa class\, open to all levels — no partner needed.\nFrom 9pm the DJ takes over\, playing salsa\, bachata\, merengue and reggaeton all night. The dance floor is open to everyone\, from first-timers to experienced dancers\, in a welcoming and high-energy atmosphere.\nLa Terraza offers happy hour drinks\, beer buckets and late-night tapas throughout the evening\, making it a full night out as well as a dance social. Free early bird tickets are available on Eventbrite each week.
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/sabor-latino/2026-07-24/
LOCATION:La Terraza Tapas Bar & Restaurant\, 27-31 Bedford Rd\, London\, SW4 7SH\, United Kingdom
CATEGORIES:London
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golatindance.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/92eb9234-8e33-4ee5-aac6-25c54efe1034-1.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="@laterrazaclaphma":MAILTO:Laterrazaclapham@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
