BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Go Latin Dance
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260724T190000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260725T000000
DTSTAMP:20260724T233818
CREATED:20260712T011241Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260712T011241Z
UID:10459728-1784919600-1784937600@golatindance.com
SUMMARY:Funky Mambo's Monthly Friday Salsa Party @ Leaf & Cane
DESCRIPTION:🎶 Funky Mambo @ Leaf & Cane – Salsa Classes & Party 💃🕺 \nGet ready\, London! 🌆 Funky Mambo – the city’s premier Mambo school – is teaming up with the vibrant Latin cocktail bar Leaf & Cane 🍹 to bring you an exciting monthly Friday Salsa Night right in the heart of the City. \nJoin us for Funky Mambo @ Leaf & Cane – a night of rhythm\, fun\, cocktails\, and dancing 🥳🔥 – perfect for kicking off your weekend in style! \n📍 Venue: Leaf & Cane\, Hyatt Regency\, 19 New Bridge St\, London EC4V 6DB\n🚉 Just 1 min from Blackfriars Station\n✨ Latin American-inspired bar with handcrafted cocktails 🍸\, premium rums 🥃\, delicious food 🍴 & an outdoor terrace 🌿\n*Salsa Special Drink Menu! – Discount on selected drinks when you show your wristband at the bar. \n🗓 Upcoming 2026 Dates: \n🫶 Fri\, 24 July – Vinyl Record Night ft. DJ Erick the Saint\n💥 Fri\, 14 August (TBC)\n✨️ Fri\, 25 September (TBC)\n👠 Fri 9 October (TBC)\n🪘 Fri 13 November (TBC)\n🎄 Fri\, 11 December (TBC) \n🕖 Evening Schedule: \n7:00pm – Registration opens 📝\n7:15pm – FREE 30-min Intro Salsa Class (Absolute beginners welcome! 🙌)\n8:00pm – Salsa Classes with Funky Mambo 🏆\n9:00pm–Midnight – Party & Social Dancing with top Salsa DJs 🎧💃 \n💷 Pricing:\n£15 – Classes + Party\n£10 – Party Only\n£2 Off – Concession w/ a valid photo card \nAge: 18+ \nTICKETS:\nAvailable online at Funky Mambo Ticket Shop\, Eventbrite\, or CASH\, Apple/GooglePay at the door. \n🎫 https://funkymambo.socialdance.net/ \nPARKING:\n1. Street Parking\nTudor Street and the surrounding areas are mostly single yellow lines\, so it’s free after 6:30 p.m.\nNo congestion charge after 6 p.m. \n2. Baynard House Car Park\nThe Hyatt Regency (where the event is) suggests this parking spot: \nhttps://www.hyatt.com/hyatt-regency/en-US/lonrb-hyatt-regency-london-blackfriars/parking-and-transportation \nBaynard House Car Park\nhttps://share.google/3zgrwFwoui3ZD2uWl \nIt’s open 24/7.\nOn Fridays after 7 p.m.\, it’s a one-time payment of £4.50 – £7.30 (depends on your car). \n🏍🚲 Motorcycles and bicycles — complimentary in designated bays. \n============ \nWhether you’re brand new to Salsa or already dancing in your sleep 😴🕺\, this is your chance to enjoy top-quality classes\, meet fun people\, and dance the night away 💫 in one of London’s most stylish hidden gems. \n👠 Grab your friends\, your dancing shoes\, and let’s Mambo under the city lights! 🌃✨ \n📲 Follow @FunkyMamboUK & @LeafAndCane on Instagram & Facebook for updates\, vibes & videos. \n🔥 See you on the dancefloor! \n#SalsaParty #SalsaLondon #SalsaClasses #FreeSalsa #SalsaLesso#SalsaSocial #FridaySalsa #FunkyMambo #LeafAndCane #Brackfrias #SalsaInTheCity #SalsaDancing
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/funky-mambos-monthly-friday-salsa-party-leaf-cane/
LOCATION:Hyatt Regency Leaf & Cane\, 19 New Bridge St\, London\, ECAV 6DB\, United Kingdom
CATEGORIES:London
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://golatindance.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1000115172.png
END:VEVENT
