SUMMARY:Latin Fridays & Saturdays at Lula Lounge
DESCRIPTION:Weekends\, we go to Havana\, where the vibrant rhythms ignite our souls and live music\, dance lessons\, & skillful DJs make it a perfect night! \n \nArrive between 7pm and 8pm to indulge in a delectable three-course dinner and explore the Lula carefully curated bar menu\, featuring our signature tropical cocktails. The dance lesson at 9pm will ease you into the Latin groove\, preparing you for a night of dancing to the tropical rhythms of one of Lula’s world-famous live salsa orchestras\, performing two sets starting at 10pm and midnight. \nBetween live music sets\, Lula’s talented DJs keep the party going with a mix of top 40\, salsa\, bachata\, reggaeton\, and other Latin hits. Don’t miss out on this electrifying night! \nAgenda \n7:00 PM\nDoors Open for Dinner and Drinks\nArrive between 7 and 8 pm to enjoy a fabulous dinner and tropical drinks. Reservations available at lula.ca/reservations \n9:00 PM\nBeginner’s Dance Lesson\nGet ready to have some fun and break the ice with a beginners dance lesson provided some of the best dance schools in the city. (No partner necessary!) \n10:00 PM\nLive Salsa Set 1\nToronto’s best salsa bands take to the stage and deliver irresistible tropical rhythms. Nothing compares to experiencing this music with a LIVE band! \n11:00 PM\nDJ Set 1\nOur featured DJ returns to keep the party going until closing with more top 40\, salsa\, bachata\, reggeaton and Latin hits. \nSecond Salsa and DJ Set are for Saturdays Only\n12:00 AM\nLive Salsa Set 2\nToronto’s best salsa bands take to the stage and deliver some of the best tropical rhythms this side of Havana! \n1:00 AM\nDJ Set 2\nOur featured DJ returns to keep the party going until closing with more top 40\, salsa\, bachata\, reggeaton and Latin hits.
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/latin-fridays-at-lula-lounge/2026-07-24/
LOCATION:Lula Lounge\, 1585 Dundas Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, M6K 1T9\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Toronto
END:VEVENT
